204| \begin{exercise}[$\star\star$]\label{exo:g7:short-circuits-safety:11}
205| Christmas morning mystery: grandmother's string of series
206| fairy-lights has one bulb whose inner support wires have fused
207| together in dying --- short-circuiting itself. Contrary to the
208| usual tragedy, the \emph{rest of the string keeps shining}, a
209| little brighter. Explain --- and say what is now slowly being
210| prepared for the remaining bulbs.
211| \end{exercise}
