213| \begin{exercise}[$\star\star\star$]\label{exo:g7:short-circuits-safety:12}
214| Design the protection plan of a small workshop: three parallel
215| branches (lights; power tools; a battery charger), one supply.
216| Place guards and switches; choose which branches deserve their
217| own guard and why; and write the two-line notice above the fuse
218| drawer that summarizes
219| \cref{rem:g7:short-circuits-safety:nail}.
220| \end{exercise}
